  "title": {
   "en": "The Widow Who Got Set Up Won't Forgive the PTA"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ハメられた未亡人はPTAを許さない"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Hamerareta Miboujin wa PTA wo Yurusanai"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a local elementary school where there is a huge gap between the rich and the poor, Shiraishi Yukino, a mother of twins, goes from celebrity to stardom after the death of her husband, who worked for the Board of Education. In order to clear her husband's name, Yukino tries to use her body to get closer to the PTA, which holds the key to the case, but gradually becomes addicted to pleasure... What is the truth behind her husband's death? And what fate awaits Yukino...? An immoral revenge erotic suspense story!",
   "ja": "貧富の格差が激しいとある地域の小学校。\n双子の母、白石ゆき乃は、教育委員会に勤めていた夫の死をきっかけにセレブから急転落してしまう。\n夫の無念を晴らすべく、自分の身体を使って事件の鍵を握るPTAに近づこうとするゆき乃だったが、次第に快楽に溺れていき…？\n夫の死の真相は？\nそしてゆき乃を待ち受ける運命とは…？\n背徳のリベンジエロティックサスペンス！"
  },
